{
  "docs/guides/gfm-tables.md": "<h1 id=\"user-content-gfm-tables\" data-line-start=\"6\" data-line-end=\"6\">GFM Tables</h1>\n<p data-line-start=\"8\" data-line-end=\"8\">A plain table:</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table data-line-start=\"10\" data-line-end=\"13\"><thead><tr><th>Backend</th><th align=\"center\">Local</th><th align=\"right\">Server</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>SQLite</td><td align=\"center\">yes</td><td align=\"right\">no</td></tr><tr><td>Postgres</td><td align=\"center\">no</td><td align=\"right\">yes</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p data-line-start=\"15\" data-line-end=\"16\">Alignment above: centre, then right. A table with inline formatting and a\npipe escaped inside a cell:</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table data-line-start=\"18\" data-line-end=\"23\"><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>bold</strong></td><td>rendered strong</td></tr><tr><td><code>code</code></td><td>monospace</td></tr><tr><td>a | literal</td><td>the pipe is escaped, not a new column</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"gfm-tables.md#gfm-tables\">link</a></td><td>self reference</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p data-line-start=\"25\" data-line-end=\"25\">A ragged table (missing trailing cells) that parsers must tolerate:</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table data-line-start=\"27\" data-line-end=\"30\"><thead><tr><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p data-line-start=\"32\" data-line-end=\"32\">Next up: <a href=\"task-lists.md\">task lists</a>.</p>",
  "docs/guides/task-lists.md": "<h1 id=\"user-content-task-lists\" data-line-start=\"6\" data-line-end=\"6\">Task Lists</h1>\n<p data-line-start=\"8\" data-line-end=\"8\">Top-level tasks:</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\" data-line-start=\"10\" data-line-end=\"12\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled> Ship the scaffold</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> Write the ingest</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> Draw the graph view</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-line-start=\"14\" data-line-end=\"14\">Nested tasks with mixed state:</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\" data-line-start=\"16\" data-line-end=\"21\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> Release 0.1\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled> Fixtures</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled> CI</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> Docs\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> Getting started</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> API reference</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-line-start=\"23\" data-line-end=\"23\">A task item that also contains a <a href=\"footnotes.md\">link</a> and <code>inline code</code>:</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\" data-line-start=\"25\" data-line-end=\"25\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> Follow up on <a href=\"footnotes.md\">footnotes</a> once <code>catdb-query</code> lands</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-line-start=\"27\" data-line-end=\"27\">Not a task, just a bullet that happens to mention \"[ ]\" in text.</p>",
  "docs/guides/footnotes.md": "<h1 id=\"user-content-footnotes\" data-line-start=\"6\" data-line-end=\"6\">Footnotes</h1>\n<p data-line-start=\"8\" data-line-end=\"10\">CatDB stores provenance the way a good essay stores footnotes<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-prov\" id=\"user-content-fnref-prov\" aria-describedby=\"user-content-footnote-label\">1</a></sup>: every\nclaim can be traced. Vectors are just one representation<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-vec\" id=\"user-content-fnref-vec\" aria-describedby=\"user-content-footnote-label\">2</a></sup>, and they are not\nalways the right one<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-vec\" id=\"user-content-fnref-vec-2\" aria-describedby=\"user-content-footnote-label\">2</a></sup>.</p>\n<p data-line-start=\"12\" data-line-end=\"12\">A footnote can hold multiple paragraphs<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-long\" id=\"user-content-fnref-long\" aria-describedby=\"user-content-footnote-label\">3</a></sup>.</p>\n<p data-line-start=\"23\" data-line-end=\"23\">Back to the <a href=\"gfm-tables.md\">tables guide</a>.</p>\n<section class=\"footnotes\" data-line-start=\"14\" data-line-end=\"21\"><h2 class=\"sr-only\" id=\"user-content-footnote-label\">Footnotes</h2>\n<ol>\n<li id=\"user-content-fn-prov\">\n<p>Provenance = source file + byte range + ingest run. <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-prov\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 1\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">↩</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"user-content-fn-vec\">\n<p>Reused reference — the same marker can appear more than once. <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-vec\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 2\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">↩</a> <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-vec-2\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 2-2\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">↩<sup>2</sup></a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"user-content-fn-long\">\n<p>First paragraph of the long note.</p>\n<p>Second paragraph, indented so it stays part of the footnote. It can even\ncontain a <a href=\"task-lists.md\">link</a>. <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-long\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 3\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">↩</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section>",
  "docs/guides/strikethrough-autolinks.md": "<h1 id=\"user-content-strikethrough-and-autolinks\" data-line-start=\"6\" data-line-end=\"6\">Strikethrough and Autolinks</h1>\n<h2 id=\"user-content-strikethrough\" data-line-start=\"8\" data-line-end=\"8\">Strikethrough</h2>\n<p data-line-start=\"10\" data-line-end=\"11\">We <del>use RocksDB</del> use SQLite and Postgres. The <del>old plan</del> is gone.\nDouble tildes are required: <del>this</del> is not struck through in strict GFM.</p>\n<h2 id=\"user-content-autolinks\" data-line-start=\"13\" data-line-end=\"13\">Autolinks</h2>\n<p data-line-start=\"15\" data-line-end=\"15\">Bare URL, should linkify: <a href=\"https://supabase.com/docs\">https://supabase.com/docs</a></p>\n<p data-line-start=\"17\" data-line-end=\"18\">Bare URL with path and query:\n<a href=\"https://github.com/catdb-project/catdb/issues?q=is%3Aopen\">https://github.com/catdb-project/catdb/issues?q=is%3Aopen</a></p>\n<p data-line-start=\"20\" data-line-end=\"20\">Email autolink: <a href=\"mailto:mlong168@gmail.com\">mlong168@gmail.com</a></p>\n<p data-line-start=\"22\" data-line-end=\"22\">Angle-bracket autolink: <a href=\"https://example.com/angle\">https://example.com/angle</a></p>\n<p data-line-start=\"24\" data-line-end=\"24\">Not a link, just text with a dot: example dot com.</p>\n<p data-line-start=\"26\" data-line-end=\"27\">Compare with the explicit links back to <a href=\"gfm-tables.md\">tables</a> and\n<a href=\"task-lists.md\">task lists</a>.</p>",
  "docs/guides/code-fences.md": "<h1 id=\"user-content-code-fences\" data-line-start=\"6\" data-line-end=\"6\">Code Fences</h1>\n<p data-line-start=\"8\" data-line-end=\"9\">Fenced code in several languages. Each closes properly (the unclosed case lives\nin <code>edge-cases/unclosed-fence.md</code>).</p>\n<h2 id=\"user-content-rust\" data-line-start=\"11\" data-line-end=\"11\">Rust</h2>\n<pre data-line-start=\"13\" data-line-end=\"17\"><code class=\"language-rust\">pub fn embed(text: &#x26;str) -> Vec&#x3C;f32> {\n    text.split_whitespace().map(|w| w.len() as f32).collect()\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"user-content-python\" data-line-start=\"19\" data-line-end=\"19\">Python</h2>\n<pre data-line-start=\"21\" data-line-end=\"24\"><code class=\"language-python\">def chunk(md: str, size: int = 512) -> list[str]:\n    return [md[i : i + size] for i in range(0, len(md), size)]\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"user-content-typescript\" data-line-start=\"26\" data-line-end=\"26\">TypeScript</h2>\n<pre data-line-start=\"28\" data-line-end=\"32\"><code class=\"language-typescript\">export function toBindings(cmds: string[]): string {\n  return cmds.map((c) => `export const ${c}: Command;`).join(\"\\n\");\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"user-content-sql\" data-line-start=\"34\" data-line-end=\"34\">SQL</h2>\n<pre data-line-start=\"36\" data-line-end=\"39\"><code class=\"language-sql\">create index notes_trgm on notes using gin (body gin_trgm_ops);\nselect id from notes order by embedding &#x3C;-> $1 limit 10;\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"user-content-bash\" data-line-start=\"41\" data-line-end=\"41\">Bash</h2>\n<pre data-line-start=\"43\" data-line-end=\"47\"><code class=\"language-bash\">#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\ncargo test --workspace\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"user-content-json\" data-line-start=\"49\" data-line-end=\"49\">JSON</h2>\n<pre data-line-start=\"51\" data-line-end=\"53\"><code class=\"language-json\">{ \"path\": \"index.md\", \"features\": [\"hub\", \"image\", \"wikilink\"] }\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"user-content-toml\" data-line-start=\"55\" data-line-end=\"55\">TOML</h2>\n<pre data-line-start=\"57\" data-line-end=\"61\"><code class=\"language-toml\">[db]\nport = 54322\nmajor_version = 17\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"user-content-indented-no-language\" data-line-start=\"63\" data-line-end=\"63\">Indented (no language)</h2>\n<pre data-line-start=\"65\" data-line-end=\"66\"><code>plain indented code block\nstill code\n</code></pre>\n<p data-line-start=\"68\" data-line-end=\"68\">An inline <code>code span</code> and a fence with a tilde delimiter:</p>\n<pre data-line-start=\"70\" data-line-end=\"72\"><code class=\"language-text\">tilde-fenced block\n</code></pre>",
  "edge-cases/unclosed-fence.md": "<h1 id=\"user-content-unclosed-fence\" data-line-start=\"6\" data-line-end=\"6\">Unclosed Fence</h1>\n<p data-line-start=\"8\" data-line-end=\"10\">The paragraph before the fence is normal. Below, a code fence opens and is never\nclosed — the rest of the file should be treated as code until EOF, and the\nparser must not hang or crash.</p>\n<pre data-line-start=\"12\" data-line-end=\"18\"><code class=\"language-rust\">fn main() {\n    println!(\"this fence is never closed\");\n    // no closing backticks follow — EOF ends the block\n    let x = 1;\n    let y = 2;\n</code></pre>",
  "docs/guides/mermaid-flowchart.md": "<h1 id=\"user-content-mermaid-flowchart\" data-line-start=\"6\" data-line-end=\"6\">Mermaid Flowchart</h1>\n<p data-line-start=\"8\" data-line-end=\"8\">The ingest-to-answer pipeline:</p>\n<pre data-line-start=\"10\" data-line-end=\"22\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart LR\n    A[Markdown files] --> B[Ingest]\n    B --> C[(Storage)]\n    B --> D[Embed]\n    D --> C\n    C --> E{Query engine}\n    E --> F[Lexical search]\n    E --> G[Semantic search]\n    F --> H[Ranked results]\n    G --> H\n    H --> I[Provenance-attached answer]\n</code></pre>\n<p data-line-start=\"24\" data-line-end=\"24\">A second, tiny diagram in the same file:</p>\n<pre data-line-start=\"26\" data-line-end=\"29\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart TD\n    Start --> Stop\n</code></pre>\n<p data-line-start=\"31\" data-line-end=\"32\">Prose after the diagrams so it is not the last block. Related:\n<a href=\"mermaid-sequence.md\">sequence diagram</a>.</p>",
  "docs/guides/katex-inline.md": "<h1 id=\"user-content-katex-inline-math\" data-line-start=\"6\" data-line-end=\"6\">KaTeX Inline Math</h1>\n<p data-line-start=\"8\" data-line-end=\"10\">Cosine similarity between vectors <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span> and <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span> is\n<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos\\theta = \\frac{a \\cdot b}{\\lVert a \\rVert \\, \\lVert b \\rVert}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4001em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">∥</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span>, which is <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>\nwhen they point the same way and <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span> when orthogonal.</p>\n<p data-line-start=\"12\" data-line-end=\"12\">The dot product <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\cdot b = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} a_i b_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> appears inline mid-sentence.</p>\n<p data-line-start=\"14\" data-line-end=\"14\">A dollar sign that is <em>not</em> math: it costs $5, and <code>$PATH</code> in code is untouched.</p>\n<p data-line-start=\"16\" data-line-end=\"16\">Greek and subscripts inline: <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_0, \\beta_1, \\gamma_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>\n<p data-line-start=\"18\" data-line-end=\"18\">For display math see <a href=\"katex-block.md\">the block math note</a>.</p>",
  "docs/guides/katex-block.md": "<h1 id=\"user-content-katex-block-math\" data-line-start=\"6\" data-line-end=\"6\">KaTeX Block Math</h1>\n<p data-line-start=\"8\" data-line-end=\"8\">Softmax over logits:</p>\n<div data-line-start=\"10\" data-line-end=\"12\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msup><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma(z)_i = \\frac{e^{z_i}}{\\sum_{j=1}^{K} e^{z_j}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6484em;vertical-align:-1.307em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3414em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1288em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6065em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.0051em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist