ble\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p data-line-start=\"29\" data-line-end=\"30\">Inline math still works here too: <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{i\\pi} + 1 = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.908em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">iπ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>. See also\n<a href=\"katex-inline.md\">inline math</a>.</p>",
  "notes/zettel/wikilinks.md": "<h1 id=\"user-content-wiki-link-syntax\" data-line-start=\"6\" data-line-end=\"6\">Wiki-link Syntax</h1>\n<p data-line-start=\"8\" data-line-end=\"8\">A plain link to another note: <wiki-link class=\"wikilink\" data-wikilink=\"true\" data-target=\"node-storage\">node-storage</wiki-link>.</p>\n<p data-line-start=\"10\" data-line-end=\"10\">A link with a label: <wiki-link class=\"wikilink\" data-wikilink=\"true\" data-target=\"node-query-engine\" data-label=\"the query engine\">the query engine</wiki-link>.</p>\n<p data-line-start=\"12\" data-line-end=\"12\">A link to a heading inside a note: <wiki-link class=\"wikilink\" data-wikilink=\"true\" data-target=\"node-search\" data-heading=\"Search\">node-search#Search</wiki-link>.</p>\n<p data-line-start=\"14\" data-line-end=\"15\">A link to a heading with a custom label:\n<wiki-link class=\"wikilink\" data-wikilink=\"true\" data-target=\"node-embeddings\" data-heading=\"Embeddings\" data-label=\"how vectors work\">how vectors work</wiki-link>.</p>\n<p data-line-start=\"17\" data-line-end=\"18\">Links can sit inline in a sentence — see <wiki-link class=\"wikilink\" data-wikilink=\"true\" data-target=\"graph-hub\">graph-hub</wiki-link> for the whole web — or\nstacked in a list:</p>\n<ul data-line-start=\"20\" data-line-end=\"22\">\n<li><wiki-link class=\"wikilink\" data-wikilink=\"true\" data-target=\"node-ingest\">node-ingest</wiki-link></li>\n<li><wiki-link class=\"wikilink\" data-wikilink=\"true\" data-target=\"node-provenance\">node-provenance</wiki-link></li>\n<li><wiki-link class=\"wikilink\" data-wikilink=\"true\" data-target=\"node-graph-view\">node-graph-view</wiki-link></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-line-start=\"24\" data-line-end=\"24\">Contrast these with the deliberately <wiki-link class=\"wikilink\" data-wikilink=\"true\" data-target=\"broken-links\" data-label=\"broken ones\">broken ones</wiki-link>.</p>",
  "notes/zettel/broken-links.md": "<h1 id=\"user-content-broken-links\" data-line-start=\"6\" data-line-end=\"6\">Broken Links</h1>\n<p data-line-start=\"8\" data-line-end=\"9\">These wiki-links point at notes that do not exist and must resolve to dangling\nstubs, not crashes:</p>\n<ul data-line-start=\"11\" data-line-end=\"15\">\n<li><wiki-link class=\"wikilink\" data-wikilink=\"true\" data-target=\"ghost-node\">ghost-node</wiki-link></li>\n<li><wiki-link class=\"wikilink\" data-wikilink=\"true\" data-target=\"node-that-was-deleted\">node-that-was-deleted</wiki-link></li>\n<li><wiki-link class=\"wikilink\" data-wikilink=\"true\" data-target=\"archive/old-note\">archive/old-note</wiki-link></li>\n<li><wiki-link class=\"wikilink\" data-wikilink=\"true\" data-target=\"node-storage\" data-heading=\"Nonexistent Heading\">node-storage#Nonexistent Heading</wiki-link></li>\n<li><wiki-link class=\"wikilink\" data-wikilink=\"true\" data-target=\"\" data-label=\"empty target\">empty target</wiki-link></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-line-start=\"17\" data-line-end=\"18\">A broken relative markdown link too:\n<a href=\"../projects/does-not-exist.md\">missing file</a>.</p>\n<p data-line-start=\"20\" data-line-end=\"20\">And a broken anchor within this file: <a href=\"#no-such-heading\">jump</a>.</p>\n<p data-line-start=\"22\" data-line-end=\"22\">For the links that <em>do</em> work, see <wiki-link class=\"wikilink\" data-wikilink=\"true\" data-target=\"wikilinks\">wikilinks</wiki-link> and <wiki-link class=\"wikilink\" data-wikilink=\"true\" data-target=\"graph-hub\">graph-hub</wiki-link>.</p>",
  "frontmatter/typical.md": "<h1 id=\"user-content-typical-frontmatter\" data-line-start=\"15\" data-line-end=\"15\">Typical Frontmatter</h1>\n<p data-line-start=\"17\" data-line-end=\"18\">A normal note with a full YAML frontmatter block: strings, a date, a list of\ntags, a boolean, and a number. The body then continues as usual.</p>\n<p data-line-start=\"20\" data-line-end=\"22\">This is the happy path for the frontmatter parser. Compare with the\n<a href=\"empty-frontmatter.md\">empty</a>, <a href=\"malformed-frontmatter.md\">malformed</a>, and\n<a href=\"frontmatter-only.md\">frontmatter-only</a> cases.</p>",
  "frontmatter/malformed-frontmatter.md": "<h1 id=\"user-content-malformed-frontmatter\" data-line-start=\"11\" data-line-end=\"11\">Malformed Frontmatter</h1>\n<p data-line-start=\"13\" data-line-end=\"16\">The YAML above is deliberately broken: an unclosed flow sequence, a key with no\ncolon, doubled colons, and inconsistent indentation. A robust ingest should\nrecover — surface a metadata-parse warning, keep <code>title</code> if it can, and still\nrender the body — rather than dropping the whole document.</p>\n<p data-line-start=\"18\" data-line-end=\"18\">Compare with <a href=\"typical.md\">typical</a>.</p>",
  "docs/reference/headings-with-inline.md": "<h1 id=\"user-content-using-catdb-query-in-practice\" data-line-start=\"6\" data-line-end=\"6\">Using <code>catdb-query</code> in Practice</h1>\n<p data-line-start=\"8\" data-line-end=\"8\">A heading containing inline code.</p>\n<h2 id=\"user-content-see-the-overview\" data-line-start=\"10\" data-line-end=\"10\">See the <a href=\"../../notes/projects/catdb-overview.md\">overview</a></h2>\n<p data-line-start=\"12\" data-line-end=\"12\">A heading containing a link.</p>\n<h3 id=\"user-content-bold-and-italic-mixed-in-a-heading\" data-line-start=\"14\" data-line-end=\"14\">Bold <strong>and</strong> italic <em>mixed</em> in a heading</h3>\n<p data-line-start=\"16\" data-line-end=\"16\">A heading with emphasis.</p>\n<h4 id=\"user-content-math-in-a-heading-e--mc2\" data-line-start=\"18\" data-line-end=\"18\">Math in a heading: <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = mc^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4>\n<p data-line-start=\"20\" data-line-end=\"20\">A heading containing inline math.</p>\n<h5 id=\"user-content-emoji-in-a-heading-\" data-line-start=\"22\" data-line-end=\"22\">Emoji in a heading 🚀</h5>\n<p data-line-start=\"24\" data-line-end=\"24\">A heading with an emoji, to test slug generation.</p>",
  "edge-cases/unicode-emoji-cjk.md": "<h1 id=\"user-content-unicode--表意文字-テスト\" data-line-start=\"6\" data-line-end=\"6\">Unicode 🌍 表意文字 テスト</h1>\n<p data-line-start=\"8\" data-line-end=\"8\">Mixed scripts in one heading and one body.</p>\n<h2 id=\"user-content-emoji\" data-line-start=\"10\" data-line-end=\"10\">Emoji</h2>\n<p data-line-start=\"12\" data-line-end=\"13\">Status: ✅ done, 🚧 in progress, ❌ blocked. Family: 👩‍👩‍👧‍👦 (a ZWJ sequence that\nis one grapheme but several code points). Flags: 🇯🇵 🇰🇷 🇺🇸. Skin tone: 👍🏽.</p>\n<h2 id=\"user-content-cjk\" data-line-start=\"15\" data-line-end=\"15\">CJK</h2>\n<ul data-line-start=\"17\" data-line-end=\"19\">\n<li>中文：知识库把文档变成向量。</li>\n<li>日本語：ドキュメントをベクトルに変換します。</li>\n<li>한국어: 문서를 벡터로 변환합니다.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"user-content-diacritics-and-rtl\" data-line-start=\"21\" data-line-end=\"21\">Diacritics and RTL</h2>\n<p data-line-start=\"23\" data-line-end=\"23\">Café, naïve, Zürich, Håkon, Þorvaldur. Arabic: مرحبا بالعالم. Hebrew: שלום עולם.</p>\n<h2 id=\"user-content-widths-and-combining-marks\" data-line-start=\"25\" data-line-end=\"25\">Widths and combining marks</h2>\n<p data-line-start=\"27\" data-line-end=\"27\">Full-width ＡＢＣ next to ASCII ABC. Combining: e + ́ = é. Zalgo-lite: a̐b̽c̈.</p>\n<p data-line-start=\"29\" data-line-end=\"30\">Character counts here are a good test for byte-vs-grapheme offset handling in\n<a href=\"../notes/zettel/node-provenance.md\">provenance</a>.</p>",
  "entities/named-prose": "<p data-line-start=\"1\" data-line-end=\"1\">Ben &#x26; Jerry © 2026 — a dash, … and ™. Non breaking space.</p>",
  "entities/named-edge-cases": "<p data-line-start=\"1\" data-line-end=\"1\">Set: a ∉ B, but &#x26;notit; is not-it. Also &#x3C;tag> and \"q\" 'a'.</p>",
  "entities/numeric-decimal-hex-astral": "<p data-line-start=\"1\" data-line-end=\"1\">Decimal — em dash, hex — em dash, astral 😀 grin, 😀 grin again.</p>",
  "entities/in-code-contexts": "<p data-line-start=\"1\" data-line-end=\"1\">Inline <code>&#x26;amp; &#x26;copy; &#x26;#x1F600;</code> code, then a block:</p>\n<pre data-line-start=\"3\" data-line-end=\"5\"><code>&#x26;amp; &#x26;mdash; &#x26;#8212; &#x26;#x1F600;\n</code></pre>\n<p data-line-start=\"7\" data-line-end=\"7\">And prose &#x26; after.</p>",
  "entities/in-headings-and-links": "<h1 id=\"user-content-heading---\" data-line-start=\"1\" data-line-end=\"1\">Heading &#x26; © —</h1>\n<p data-line-start=\"3\" data-line-end=\"3\">A <a href=\"https://example.test/?a=1&#x26;b=2\">link &#x26; text</a> and <em>emph ™</em>.</p>"
}
